  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "In Central Continent Earth Abyss, Ying Wu Xie warns Hei Lou Lan and Tai Bai Yun Sheng when the Gu activates again inside a soul beast they are fighting.",
        "chapters": [
          1039
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "reg_central_continent",
          "reg_earth_earth_abyss",
          "char_ying_wu_xie",
          "char_hei_lou_lan",
          "char_tai_bai_yun_sheng"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "When Ying Wu Xie, Hei Lou Lan, and Tai Bai Yun Sheng push that beast into danger, the Gu reacts and unleashes its power, buying the beast time and space to retaliate. They have to retreat. Their heads spin and their souls take heavy injury; Tai Bai Yun Sheng’s seven orifices bleed. Ying Wu Xie judges the host was once an ancient desolate soul beast that fell to desolate beast level after escaping an intense battle while the Gu kept activating.",
        "chapters": [
          1039
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "earth-abyss-fight",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Hei Lou Lan later praises the Gu formation used there: even though the soul beast had soul howl Immortal Gu, it still died in a short time. Ying Wu Xie, Tai Bai Yun Sheng, and Hei Lou Lan then search the ancient soul beast’s corpse for its soul core.",
        "chapters": [
          1042
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "earth-abyss-outcome",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_hei_lou_lan",
          "sys_gu_formation",
          "sys_immortal_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Ying Wu Xie later says he obtained rank seven soul howl Gu earlier. Together with some mortal Gu, that lets him use an immortal killer move that burns his soul as fuel while his luck rises.",
        "chapters": [
          1068
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "ying-wu-xie-obtains-the-gu",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_mortal_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Against Fang Yuan, Ying Wu Xie uses an immortal killer move named Soul Howl. Its power covers the sky without hitting the other Gu Immortals beside him. Fang Yuan lacks a method to protect his soul against soul path Immortal Gu and is hit, but his soul foundation and guts Gu let him endure.",
        "chapters": [
          1257
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "named-soul-howl",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "sys_gu_immortal",
          "gu_guts_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "He uses that same named move again in a later clash, where phantoms of Fang Yuan burst under the howl.",
        "chapters": [
          1259
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "named-soul-howl",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
